---
title: Coconut Tofu Katsu Curry
description: This one comes out on rotation pretty much every week in our kitchens and honestly we don't see that changing any time soon. There's something about crispy golden tofu coated in panko, sitting in a rich, gently spiced coconut katsu sauce, that just hits every single time. You get that satisfying crunch, the creamy warmth of the curry, and then the quick pickled cucumber and red onion cutting right through it all. It's the kind of meal that feels like a proper treat but comes together in about 25 minutes. Make this tonight, you won't regret it.
